WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 9247bff9de74f40326d826673828fc84

00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:05.035
Karibu kwenye uchambuzi mwingine wa kina. Natumaini
unafurahia mazoezi haya.

00:00:05.275 --> 00:00:07.275
Hili ni zoezi la kwanza
ambapo kweli

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:09.555
tunaanza kuunganisha
dhana kadhaa tofauti.

00:00:09.555 --> 00:00:12.476
Nadhani ni zoezi zuri
na la kufurahisha kidogo.

00:00:14.635 --> 00:00:15.996
Nitalipitia haraka pamoja nawe.

00:00:16.655 --> 00:00:18.955
Ni jambo tulilolishughulikia pia
kwenye video ya kufundishia.

00:00:18.955 --> 00:00:24.396
Lakini hebu tuangalie kidogo. Tunajua
kwamba tunataka kufanya kitu mara tisa.

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:27.905
Hicho ndicho kidokezo chetu cha kwanza.
Tunataka kupanda maua tisa,

00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:30.986
na tunajua nafasi ambazo
tunataka kuyapanda.

00:00:30.986 --> 00:00:35.265
10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80, na 90.

00:00:36.466 --> 00:00:39.786
Kwa hiyo natumaini unaona
kwamba yote yamepishana kwa 10.

00:00:39.786 --> 00:00:44.225
Na tunakuambia hivyo hapa. Ua la kwanza
liko 10, ua la pili liko 20.

00:00:44.865 --> 00:00:47.466
Kwa hiyo tunataka kurudia kitu. Basi,

00:00:47.466 --> 00:00:49.345
hebu kwanza tufanye hivi
bila kurudia, kwa muda kidogo.

00:00:49.345 --> 00:00:53.345
Hebu tufikirie tu. Njia ya
kufanya hivi kwa mkono bila

00:00:54.176 --> 00:00:57.295
kutumia repeat ni hii,
ambayo inachosha sana,

00:00:59.536 --> 00:01:01.456
lakini ni mtindo wenye manufaa kuuona.

00:01:01.456 --> 00:01:03.456
Kwa hiyo tunapanda kitu kama hiki.

00:01:04.016 --> 00:01:08.096
Na tunachotaka kuweza kufanya ni kusema,
sawa basi, hebu turudie mara tisa.

00:01:10.096 --> 00:01:10.495
Na

00:01:11.456 --> 00:01:14.695
tunataka tu kufanya hivi. Lakini
mara ya kwanza tunataka iwe 10.

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:17.055
Mara inayofuata, 20. Inayofuata, 30.

00:01:17.376 --> 00:01:19.135
Kwa hiyo kwa hilo, tunahitaji variable.

00:01:19.135 --> 00:01:20.896
Tunahitaji sanduku linalohifadhi thamani yetu.

00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:24.016
Tunahitaji kulisasisha sanduku hilo
kwa thamani mpya kila mara.

00:01:24.525 --> 00:01:27.165
Kisha tunahitaji kuitoa na
kuiweka kwenye kitendakazi cha plant.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:32.126
Ili kufanya hivyo, tuna kidokezo cha jina
tunaloweza kuipa variable hapa.

00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:34.046
position. Lakini tungeweza kuiita
jina lolote tunalopenda.

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:35.245
Lakini hebu tuseme position.

00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:38.365
Na hebu tuiwekee sifuri.

00:01:38.846 --> 00:01:43.566
Kisha kila mara mwanzoni mwa
kitanzi, tutaiongezea 10,

00:01:44.206 --> 00:01:47.566
na kisha tutaitumia
ndani ya kitendakazi.

00:01:48.126 --> 00:01:52.046
Na ndivyo hivyo. Ni rahisi kabisa, lakini
hebu tuangalie kidogo kinachotokea

00:01:52.046 --> 00:01:54.516
hasa hapa. Nitayaacha tu
maua haya mazuri yachipuke.

00:01:54.665 --> 00:01:55.546
Yachanue. Sawa,

00:01:56.426 --> 00:01:59.146
kwa hiyo hebu tutumie kitelezi
na tupitie haraka,

00:01:59.546 --> 00:02:01.546
tuhakikishe tuna modeli ya kiakili iliyo nzuri.

00:02:01.786 --> 00:02:06.346
Tunaunda variable mpya, sanduku jipya,
kama tunavyoliita, linaloitwa position.

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:11.026
Na tunaweka sifuri ndani yake.
Kisha tunarudia mara tisa.

00:02:11.026 --> 00:02:12.105
Na mara ya kwanza,

00:02:13.385 --> 00:02:18.346
tunaanza, tunaingia, na
tunachukua sanduku hili, position.

00:02:18.985 --> 00:02:21.306
Tunaangalia kilichomo ndani yake,
ambacho kwa sasa ni 0.

00:02:22.306 --> 00:02:26.306
Kisha tunasema 0 jumlisha 10,
ambayo inatupa 10.

00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:30.306
Kisha tunairudisha 10
kwenye sanduku lilelile.

00:02:30.705 --> 00:02:33.985
Kwa hiyo tunachukua sanduku, tunaangalia
ndani yake, tunaona ni sifuri.

00:02:33.985 --> 00:02:38.145
Tunafanya sifuri jumlisha 10, tunapata 10,
tunairudisha kwenye sanduku.

00:02:38.145 --> 00:02:41.985
Hii ni hatua moja tu.
Hiyo ndiyo hatua nzima.

00:02:43.105 --> 00:02:44.906
Kisha tunaendelea kwenye
mstari unaofuata wa msimbo.

00:02:44.906 --> 00:02:48.635
Hatua inayofuata. Kwa wakati huu,
tunachukua sanduku kutoka rafuni tena.

00:02:48.876 --> 00:02:52.795
Tunatoa 10 ndani yake. Kisha
tunatumia plant hii, kwa hapa 10,

00:02:52.955 --> 00:02:57.116
kupanda mmea kwenye
nafasi ya 10. Kisha tunapitia tena.

00:02:57.116 --> 00:02:58.876
Tunarudia. Hii ni mara ya pili.

00:03:00.475 --> 00:03:04.876
Tunachukua sanduku kutoka rafuni. Tunatoa 10,
ambayo ndiyo tuliyoiweka mara iliyopita.

00:03:05.036 --> 00:03:08.716
Tunafanya 10 jumlisha 10, tunapata 20,
tunairudisha kwenye sanduku.

00:03:09.276 --> 00:03:12.556
Kisha tunaendelea na tunaita plant kwa 20.

00:03:15.735 --> 00:03:19.336
Mara ya tatu, tunaingia. Safari hii
sanduku tayari lina 20 ndani yake.

00:03:19.336 --> 00:03:21.735
Kwa hiyo tunaongeza 10, tunapata 30,
na kadhalika.

00:03:23.175 --> 00:03:24.295
Kwa hiyo unaweza kuona hapa,

00:03:26.216 --> 00:03:27.575
dhana hii ni

00:03:28.376 --> 00:03:31.895
rahisi kabisa. Chukua sanduku, angalia kilichomo,
fanya kitu juu yake,

00:03:31.895 --> 00:03:32.936
kirudishe kwenye sanduku.

00:03:34.616 --> 00:03:37.575
Lakini usipotenganisha
hatua moja moja,

00:03:37.575 --> 00:03:39.735
inaweza kutatanisha sana
kuyashika yote kichwani.

00:03:39.816 --> 00:03:41.936
Ni muhimu sana kufikiri hivi:
mwishoni mwa hatua hii,

00:03:41.936 --> 00:03:43.975
Jiki amechukua sanduku, amefanya kitu.

00:03:44.056 --> 00:03:46.996
Amerudisha sanduku. Sasa ameketi tu
akipumzika,

00:03:46.996 --> 00:03:48.675
akisubiri mstari unaofuata wa msimbo.

00:03:48.915 --> 00:03:53.635
Ukweli kwamba mstari unaofuata wa msimbo
pia unatumia sanduku, hauna umuhimu sana.

00:03:53.635 --> 00:03:55.436
Yaani, hutaki kulifikiria hilo sana.

00:03:55.436 --> 00:03:58.836
Weka kila mstari wa msimbo
peke yake kichwani mwako.

00:03:59.475 --> 00:04:00.996
Jambo lingine moja ninalotaka kukuonyesha

00:04:01.955 --> 00:04:05.556
ni kwamba tungeweza pia kufanya hivi.
Hili pia ni suluhisho sahihi.

00:04:06.195 --> 00:04:09.795
Na fikiria tu, kama inakushangaza
kwamba hili ni suluhisho sahihi.

00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:12.276
Litafakari tu, na ufikirie
kwa nini ni hivyo,

00:04:13.265 --> 00:04:15.026
nami nitalipitia pamoja nawe.

00:04:15.825 --> 00:04:18.706
Safari hii tunaunda sanduku
na kuweka 10 ndani yake.

00:04:19.346 --> 00:04:21.985
Kisha tunarudia kitu mara tisa.

00:04:22.706 --> 00:04:26.386
Kwa hiyo mara moja, sasa tunapanda,
tunaenda, tunachukua sanduku.

00:04:26.386 --> 00:04:28.065
Lina 10 ndani, tunaitumia.

00:04:28.545 --> 00:04:30.466
Na baada ya hapo tunaendelea.

00:04:30.625 --> 00:04:34.906
Na tunafanya hatua ya pili, ambayo sasa ni
kuchukua sanduku, kupata 10.

00:04:34.985 --> 00:04:38.305
10 jumlisha 10 ni 20,
tunairudisha 20 kwenye sanduku.

00:04:39.165 --> 00:04:42.326
Kisha tunarudia tena na sasa
tunapanda, na tunatumia 20.

00:04:42.326 --> 00:04:44.206
Kwa hiyo ni dhana ileile kabisa.

00:04:44.446 --> 00:04:49.086
Ni kwamba tu tunasasisha thamani
iliyo kwenye sanduku baada ya kuitumia.

00:04:49.805 --> 00:04:52.045
Je, mojawapo ya haya ni sahihi
na lingine si sahihi?

00:04:52.365 --> 00:04:55.165
Hapana, yote mawili yanakubalika kabisa.

00:04:55.886 --> 00:04:58.685
Mimi binafsi napendelea
kidogo

00:04:59.086 --> 00:05:01.165
kilichopo kwenye skrini kwa sasa.

00:05:01.675 --> 00:05:04.605
Niliandika chapisho kwenye jukwaa kuhusu hili
muda fulani uliopita.

00:05:04.716 --> 00:05:09.245
Sitalipitia lote sasa, kwa sababu nadhani
unahitaji maarifa zaidi kidogo

00:05:09.245 --> 00:05:10.725
kabla halijaeleweka vizuri.

00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:11.526
Lakini

00:05:12.406 --> 00:05:13.805
jaribu yote mawili mwenyewe.

00:05:13.805 --> 00:05:17.446
Ona ni upi kati ya mitindo hii miwili
tofauti unaoridhika nao.

00:05:17.605 --> 00:05:21.446
Unaokufaa wewe. Kama nilivyosema,
hakuna ulio sahihi wala usio sahihi.

00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:23.526
Watu tofauti hawatakubaliana
kuhusu kipi ni bora.

00:05:24.086 --> 00:05:28.725
Lakini, ndiyo, jaribu yote mawili kadiri
tunavyopitia mazoezi machache yanayofuata.

00:05:29.276 --> 00:05:32.565
Wakati mwingine mmoja utakuwa
bora waziwazi kuliko mwingine.

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:36.725
Yaani, unaweza kujiokolea kazi ukifanya
huu kwanza na ule baadaye.

00:05:36.886 --> 00:05:39.365
Hakika utaliona hilo
kwenye mazoezi magumu zaidi.

00:05:39.855 --> 00:05:42.725
Lakini, ndiyo, jijengee tu tabia
ya kujaribu mambo haya,

00:05:42.725 --> 00:05:43.846
kucheza na mambo haya,

00:05:44.966 --> 00:05:47.766
na kujenga maoni yako kuhusu
unachoona ni bora.

00:05:47.766 --> 00:05:49.685
Na unaweza kubadilisha maoni yako
baadaye wakati wowote.

00:05:50.115 --> 00:05:52.725
Hilo linaruhusiwa kabisa.
Asante kwa kutazama.

00:05:53.336 --> 00:05:55.005
Natarajia kukuona
kwenye video inayofuata.

00:05:55.005 --> 00:05:55.685
Kwaheri kwa sasa.
